cked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-29T10:12:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T01:43:51Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T01:31:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123954","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123954.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123954.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-30T01:31:08Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- When **MenuBar** is placed at top or left edge of the screen or container (e.g. use anchor top-left), we can't click **MenuBar** item to open its **PopupMenu** when mouse is at the topmost or leftmost position (`y=0` or `x=0`) especially noticeable when using fullscreen mode or mouse-confined window.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9300a323-3941-48e0-ba2b-ad63c5d8e43b\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/756cd60d-6854-4578-960f-bec9afd345df\r\n\r\n### This PR also fix case like this:\r\n\r\nFor example, we have 2 items, each item width is 50 px\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n- (0, 50) (50, 100)\r\n- We can't click item at `x=0` or `x=50`\r\n\r\n**After:**\r\n- [0, 50) [50, 100)\r\n- We can click item at `x=0` or `x=50` to open its **PopupMenu**.\r\n\r\nAnd I believe this is preferred behavior than not be able to click.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n- This is my first PR and wrote by myself.\r\n- AI disclosure: AI helped me find the bug.\r\n\r\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32796908/mrp.zip) (Godot 4.7 stable)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123954/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}